                    {
                        "form_id": "bd542b07-4448-4a82-8506-245ccc4e5c7b",
                        "entry_id": "60f77fcf-6a23-3a93-a31c-c2cf11ed1382",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "onéreuse"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3d9b2aa5-9146-40d2-ab60-bf342906b017",
                        "entry_id": "60f77fcf-6a23-3a93-a31c-c2cf11ed1382",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "onéreuses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "815c4e4d-eca4-375d-8607-85dd12532d8f",
                        "entry_id": "60f77fcf-6a23-3a93-a31c-c2cf11ed1382",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pénible, difficile à supporter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9c67927-f65a-4978-814f-bfcc19b41e70",
                                "sense_id": "815c4e4d-eca4-375d-8607-85dd12532d8f",
                                "text": "Soyez sûre que les domestiques mettent toujours à contribution les bienfaits des maîtres ; qu’ils savent s’approprier de manière ou d’autre une partie de ce qu’on donne par leurs mains, et qu’ils exigent une reconnaissance très onéreuse de tout ce que le maître a fait gratuitement."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "363e5034-4f87-369c-b281-8c031c8c0435",
                        "entry_id": "60f77fcf-6a23-3a93-a31c-c2cf11ed1382",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui implique une contrepartie financière, par opposition à gratuit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "acd504b8-0472-4502-ba0d-27ddb3564609",
                                "sense_id": "363e5034-4f87-369c-b281-8c031c8c0435",
                                "text": "Un marché public étant toujours conclu à titre onéreux, les prestations doivent être effectuées en contrepartie d’un prix."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "698ee181-939c-4ef6-b36a-30f6014d4b08",
                                "sense_id": "363e5034-4f87-369c-b281-8c031c8c0435",
                                "text": "Le premier concerne la réalisation même des planches : à l’origine, Nishimuraya Yohachi annonce qu’elles seront toutes imprimées uniquement en nuances de bleu de Prusse, un pigment rare et onéreux qui vient tout juste d'être introduit de l’Occident au Japon."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc331cd7-6fb8-3e1b-9e15-8b32c43aae11",
                        "entry_id": "60f77fcf-6a23-3a93-a31c-c2cf11ed1382",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui impose des frais importants, qui est dispendieux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "hyperbole"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f0ed850-1687-4da9-8f7e-ddc1bfa3a24e",
                                "sense_id": "dc331cd7-6fb8-3e1b-9e15-8b32c43aae11",
                                "text": "Condition onéreuse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00d53c7b-4f89-4675-8c01-63139c7532e4",
                                "sense_id": "dc331cd7-6fb8-3e1b-9e15-8b32c43aae11",
                                "text": "Succession, tutelle onéreuse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cc53895-d2f8-4197-ba00-d1317ca1e66f",
                                "sense_id": "dc331cd7-6fb8-3e1b-9e15-8b32c43aae11",
                                "text": "Charge onéreuse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5229c195-ae48-4cbd-85d4-fe5fc6919371",
                                "sense_id": "dc331cd7-6fb8-3e1b-9e15-8b32c43aae11",
                                "text": "Cela lui est onéreux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d486743-09ee-4ab2-99c6-9ce866c31b21",
                                "sense_id": "dc331cd7-6fb8-3e1b-9e15-8b32c43aae11",
                                "text": "Il n’a point voulu accepter ce don, ce legs, parce qu’il lui était onéreux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a04fbc7a-dc9b-46e4-8043-67f4eeb2b642",
                                "sense_id": "dc331cd7-6fb8-3e1b-9e15-8b32c43aae11",
                                "text": "Le séjour dans cette ville est onéreux."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db0f31df-d7b1-44d2-9d02-fe20898b42de",
                        "source_entry_id": "60f77fcf-6a23-3a93-a31c-c2cf11ed1382",
                        "source_sense_description": "Pénible, difficile à supporter",
                        "target_lang_word": "onerous",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "onerous",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f745b36-8492-3f8f-8f2f-ce7695032349",
                                        "entry_id": "552ebd30-2a6a-3c37-93c1-be0b66b7b7a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Imposing or constituting a physical, mental, or figurative load which can be borne only with effort; burdensome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2f949dc-d10b-44b0-ab9f-c2c98a45b6e8",
                                                "sense_id": "4f745b36-8492-3f8f-8f2f-ce7695032349",
                                                "text": "That all this might not be too onerous on the purses of his rustic patrons, who are apt to consider the costs of schooling a grievous burden, and schoolmasters as mere drones, he had various ways of rendering himself both useful and agreeable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "098e8703-9397-44ce-87a9-e6f31c37da17",
                                                "sense_id": "4f745b36-8492-3f8f-8f2f-ce7695032349",
                                                "text": "Again, and more intensely than ever, she desired a fixed occupation,—no matter how onerous, how irksome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "598fde3a-e78d-425b-874d-6986d0b86ec1",
                                                "sense_id": "4f745b36-8492-3f8f-8f2f-ce7695032349",
                                                "text": "[I]t has become an onerous duty, a wearisome and distasteful task."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fdedb7c-851c-4645-86cd-2d40652ec1b8",
                                                "sense_id": "4f745b36-8492-3f8f-8f2f-ce7695032349",
                                                "text": "The striker's job was onerous, too, because there was so little \"give\" in the metal, and the perpetual jarring was indeed trying to the muscles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fa52b00-dbf3-404b-b78a-8380fd8f8480",
                                                "sense_id": "4f745b36-8492-3f8f-8f2f-ce7695032349",
                                                "text": "However, given current sensibilities about individual privacy and data protection, the recording of oral data is becoming increasingly onerous for researchers[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7c96470-46a7-4878-90ac-b12c682ff9c0",
                                                "sense_id": "4f745b36-8492-3f8f-8f2f-ce7695032349",
                                                "text": "People with diabetes mellitus rely predominantly on finger pricking to measure blood levels of glucose, which can be onerous."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
